[STATUS] POST /connect/token returns 200, NOT a 4xx - a grant that resolves no organization is not a refusal {BL}
[STATE] the decoded access token carries NO organization_id claim and NO permission[] claim (contrast: the same org unblocked yields organization_id plus a populated permission[]) {OBSERVED}
