[STATE] lockedState is false on that same user - an organization lock is not a global account lockout {BL}
[NAV] /company/members and /company/info redirect to /account/dashboard on this single-org fresh-sign-in path (see References for the multi-org variant, which expresses the same contract as /403) {OBSERVED}
[DOM] the account sidebar Corporate section (Company info, Company members, Sales reps) is ABSENT for the blocked member and present for an unblocked member of the same org - present/absent, never merely disabled {OBSERVED}
[DOM] /account/orders and /cart still render normally - this distinguishes no organization context from no session at all {OBSERVED}
[STATE] after the unblock the member is Active again with its original role, and a fresh sign-in restores organization_id, permission[] and the Corporate sidebar section {OBSERVED}

